ROOT=dict(id='C1455',meaning='在上方；超过；额外；超出通常程度',core='先想象一条横线：东西可以放在线上方，人可以越过这条线，数量可以多出这条线。super- 的许多意思来自这几个动作。',image='书放在上面是位置高；表现越过通常水平是程度高；困难能被翻过去是克服；生命越过危险仍延续就是幸存。',intro='拉丁 super 是在上方、越过、超过。它既随古代完整单词进入英语，也成为今天仍能造词的前缀。学这一组，先问“在什么上面、超过什么”，再看每个词的具体历史。',forms='super- 在大量现代复合词里保留；经法语可见 sur-，如 survive、surplus、surname。superus 的比较级 superior、最高级 supremus / summus 分别连接 superior、supreme、summit；sovereign 与 soprano 也经不同语言连到这一词族。字形相似不等于现代英语直接派生。',branches=[['高度、等级与顶端','superior, superiority, supreme, supremely, supremacy, summit, sovereign, sovereignty, soprano, supremum, supernal'],['越过之后仍活着','survive, survival, survivor, survivable, survivability'],['位置、叠放与额外数量','surplus, surname, surround, superposition, superscript, supernatant, supernumerary, superset, superfamily'],['表现超出一般水平','superb, superbly, superlative, superman, superwoman, superhero, supergirl, superboy, supervillain, superpowered, superstar, superstardom, supermodel, superfan'],['规模、速度和动力','supercomputer, supercomputing, superfast, supercar, superbike, supersport, supercross, supercharger, supercharge, superhighway, supermarket, superstore, supercenter, superyacht, supersize, supersized, superglue, superfine, superhot, supermax'],['有专门定义的科学用词','supersonic, supernova, supermassive, supercell, superconducting, superconductivity, superconductor, supercritical, superoxide, superfluid, supersymmetry, supertramp'],['评价、宣传与俚语','superfood, superdrug, superbug, superstorm, superbad, superfly, supergrass, supergroup, supercilious'],['越界、克服与其他历史支线','superfluous, insuperable, superable, supernatural, supernaturally, superstition, supervise, supervisory, supersede, supervene, superimpose, superstructure, superpower, supermajority, superfund, superficial, superficially, superficiality']],contrasts='supersonic 超过声速，superfast 只说非常快；supercell 描述特定雷暴结构，superstorm 是概括性强烈称呼。superior 是比较高，supreme 是最高。superfluous 强调不需要，surplus 只是多出的余量。surround 的历史有水漫过的意思，不能从现代 round 直接倒推；supercilious 的眉毛意象也要与日常动作分开。',practice='The superior design survived the test, but the team removed several superfluous features. 更好的设计通过了考验，团队却删掉了几项多余功能。三个词分别谈比较优势、经受考验和超过需要，不是同一种“超级”。',words=[],exclude={})
